Korean Basic Dictionary (한국어기초사전 / KRDICT)
================================================

This project redistributes a derived lite subset of the Korean Basic Dictionary
published by the National Institute of Korean Language (국립국어원).

- Source mirror used for builds: https://github.com/spellcheck-ko/korean-dict-nikl
- License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.0 Korea (CC-BY-SA 2.0 KR)
- Attribution: 국립국어원 한국어기초사전 (Korean Basic Dictionary)

The bundled artifact is `public/dict/krdict-lite.json.gz` (filtered entries with
Chinese equivalents; truncated for app size). Rebuild with:

  npm run generate:krdict-lite

License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/
